WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:32.670
We flew to Egypt to search for my lost memories.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:38.980
Where the door to my memories finally opened - to Egypt 3,000 years ago.

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:42.300
I really was the Pharaoh!

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:46.400
There are priests similar to Kaiba and Ishizu.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:52.220
The ultimate Shadow Game between me and Bakura begins here!

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:58.230
Meet Bandit King Bakura!

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.190
Outta the way!

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:24.090
Halt!

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:26.020
Do you realize where you are?

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:29.680
Be quiet!  Step aside if you value your lives!

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:37.360
S-Stop!

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:42.560
What's wrong, Mahad?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:46.320
The Millennium Ring is detecting a strong, dark force!

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.120
What?

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.260
Who goes there?

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.720
So this is the Pharaoh’s courtyard.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.000
Bakura!

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:08.130
We finally meet, Yugi.
Or should I say Pharaoh?

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.640
Let the game begin!

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.830
How dare you, bandit!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:16.140
We won’t let you lay a finger on the Pharaoh!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.090
You want to take me on?

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.350
Fine.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:24.780
Because all the Millennium Items are here.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.880
Millennium Items?

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.890
I’ll take your Millennium Items first!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.000
The labyrinth inside the Millennium Puzzle…

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:45.640
...contains the true door that leads to the Pharaoh’s memories.

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:51.120
But if someone without a Millennium Item enters this labyrinth...

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:55.150
...he can never leave, unless he finds that door.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.920
Will you still go?

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:59.260
Of course!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.790
Let’s go, Yugi!

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.640
And find that door!

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:06.190
You can't go.  I’ll go alone.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:07.060
Yugi!

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:11.850
I can't put you in more danger!

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:16.090
Even my other self couldn't find that door!

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:17.940
What are you talking about, Yugi?

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.620
We’re friends!

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:23.120
That's right!  While we're arguing, the other Yugi is...

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.620
We’ll face the consequences!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.690
Everyone…

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:31.160
Hold each others' hands and concentrate.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:42.780
My other self, I promise to save you.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:43.900
Yugi…

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.340
Yugi…

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:46.960
Yugi…

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:54.380
Millennium Key, guide us into the labyrinth inside the Millennium Puzzle!

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:07.240
You think you have the power to stop me?

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.250
Listen closely, bandit.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:14.140
These seven Millennium Items maintain order in this world.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:18.800
Only we can possess them, for the priests underwent spiritual training...

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.800
...and the Pharaoh is the embodiment of God.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:26.300
If an evil one, such as you, touches a Millennium Item...

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:30.170
...his soul will be incinerated and die!

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:33.700
That sounds exciting.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.810
Now I want it even more!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:40.090
Then we’ll use our power and judge you to die!

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:41.640
Not so fast!

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:46.640
Taking your lives would do me no good.

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:50.370
Hand over your Millennium Items and join my side.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.200
What?

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.770
In exchange, I'll give you this.

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:57.150
This is...

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:57.870
Can't be...

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.400
Don’t be surprised yet.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.650
I’ve brought another souvenir.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.180
What?

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:14.090
That’s Pharaoh Aknamkanon's coffin!

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:17.990
How dare you desecrate the former Pharaoh!

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:21.230
The former Pharaoh…  Does that mean...?

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:24.600
That’s my father!

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.130
How dare you!

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:29.080
This is unforgivable!

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.840
Bring the sealing tablet!

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:35.610
What are you going to do with this?

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.020
Enough talk, bandit!

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.010
Wait!  Be careful, Shada!

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:42.610
Karim?

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.620
Look at the Millennium Scale!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.990
The weight of his evil is immeasurable!

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.880
His darkness is bottomless.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:57.540
A powerful evil churns in his heart.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:02.770
Millennium Key, guide me into this criminal's heart!

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.210
His Ka is...

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.830
What's wrong, Shada?

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:23.390
His Ka is too powerful.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:26.050
That sealing tablet is too small!

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.070
Impossible!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:30.320
Stay calm!  His Ka is about to appear!

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.310
What is this Ka?

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:43.680
Unbelievable!  How could this powerful Ka exist inside a bandit?

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.740
What’s wrong?

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:51.320
Scared of my Diabound?

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:56.000
Don’t underestimate the power of the Millennium Items.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:01.200
I use the power of the Millennium Rod to seal this monster!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.980
That's the power of the Millennium Rod.

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:23.210
By sealing up my monster, do you think I've been reborn as a saint?

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:24.430
What?

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.250
The tablet is...

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:46.820
Yugi...  Yugi!

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:48.540
Wake up, Yugi!

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:53.950
Jonouchi!

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.730
Wake up, Honda!  Anzu!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.430
Where are we?

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.330
My other self's labyrinth of the heart.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:05.730
We are?

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:07.260
Yes.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:12.650
The Millennium Key's power brought us to the Pharaoh’s labyrinth of the heart.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:13.850
Shadi.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:17.150
So the true door is here somewhere?

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:20.320
Then let's search until we find it!

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.840
Just wait, my other self.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:28.290
I'll find the true door and come to you.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.720
I promise.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.220
What?

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:34.730
Yugi went to Egypt?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:40.860
Yes, along with Katsuya Jonouchi, Hiroto Honda and Anzu Mazaki.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.860
Yugi is in Egypt...

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.640
You hold on to this!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.930
It's an invitation to the ultimate Shadow Game.

00:09:56.770 --> 00:10:00.880
Aren’t you interested in your connection with Blue-Eyes?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.440
Ridiculous.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:13.260
Your sealing tablets are useless against my Diabound!

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:18.170
Now's the time for the six priests to show him our true power!

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:25.980
There are Duel Disks in this era?

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:27.140
Duel Disk?

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:33.900
The seven tablet shrines surrounding the palace contain Ka tablets.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:40.730
We made pacts with those Ka so that we can summon them using alchemy.

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:41.920
With our Diadiankhs!

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:43.560
Diadiankh?

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:47.060
That looks interesting.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.740
Seto, our enemy is powerful.

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:51.750
We must combine our powers-

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.770
No!  I can easily defeat him on my own!

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:55.330
Seto!

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:58.860
The Ka residing in my tablet shrine!

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.700
Come here and serve me!

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:16.020
This is exactly like…

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:19.030
I summon Garestgolath!

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:26.940
This looks just like a Duel Monsters duel!

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:31.240
Go, Garestgolath!  Destroy that Diabound!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:36.780
Duelists existed in this era?

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:57.690
This looks just like a Duel Monsters duel!

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:01.470
Duelists existed in this era?

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:05.600
Go, Garestgolath!  Destroy it!

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:10.950
Falcos!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:14.910
What?

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:16.710
Falcos?

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:18.410
Take this!

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.090
What?

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.960
Impossible!  He has another Ka?

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:33.600
How can he summon another Ka when he doesn’t have a tablet shrine?

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:39.840
You forgot something important.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:47.080
Since I raided Aknamkanon's tomb, I have this.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:56.480
That’s Aknamkanon’s Diadiankh!

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:01.540
That’s right.  Aknamkanon's tomb contained many tablets...

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:05.380
...that were buried to ward off evil.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:10.210
You summoned that from Aknamkanon's tomb?

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:14.050
How dare you defile the sacred Pharaoh's guardian!

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.600
Nonsense!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.740
"Sacred Pharaoh?"

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:26.090
Aknamkanon made the Millennium Items in order to gain evil power!

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:30.690
My father created the Millennium Items?

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:31.460
Wrong!

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:39.100
The great Aknamkanon ended the war between nations, bringing peace to the land!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:43.970
And left behind the Millennium Items to hope for a thousand years of peace.

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:54.840
Aknamkanon gave us the seven sacred items of justice to silence evil and criminals!

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.450
Peace?  Justice?

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:00.240
Don’t make me laugh!

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:04.750
It's true that whoever has a Millennium Item gains incredible power.

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:09.860
But it responds to the evil within their heart.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:13.490
And drags them into the darkness.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:17.720
I bet you don't know that whoever gathers the seven Millennium Items...

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:23.270
...and sets them in the tablet at Kul Elna Village gains the power of the afterlife.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:24.740
Nonsense!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:26.640
Kul Elna Village?

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:30.260
How does he know about that the village?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:34.710
Everyone who knows about that village should be dead.

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:39.940
If you have the courage, try it.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:42.020
You'll become greater than the Pharaoh.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:46.020
You'll gain the true power of the gods.

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:47.730
What do you mean?

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:49.890
Enough of your nonsense!

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:52.900
No one listen to him!

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.750
They're all lies!

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:57.680
You insult the Millennium Items, you insult us!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.040
It's unforgivable!

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:04.680
Fine.  Since you want to die so badly, I'll kill you.

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.980
Come out, Battle Ox!

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:08.020
Bastet!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:08.920
Spiria!

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:09.900
Zelua!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:10.680
Gadius!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.320
Illusion Magician!

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.520
Summon!

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:29.470
Aknamkanon, forgive me!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.690
That Ka was weak anyway.

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.750
It's nothing compared to my Diabound!

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.920
Diabound!  Helical Shockwave!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.660
It's powerful!

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:52.740
Stand your ground!

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:54.880
I’ll handle this!

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:58.280
No, Mahad.  Your Ka isn’t powerful enough.

00:15:58.280 --> 00:15:59.540
But…

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:02.800
I'll summon my new servant, Mystic Horseman!

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:05.400
Come out, Mystic Horseman!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:12.840
Karim!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:18.850
With the power of my Millennium Scale, I unite Battle Ox and Mystic Horseman's Kas!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.820
Ka Fusion!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.620
Did he say "fusion"?

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.890
Come out, Rabid Horseman!

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:38.010
Rabid Horseman, attack Diabound!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:42.950
So annoying!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:53.650
It can’t move anymore.

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:56.000
Are you sure?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:56.760
What?

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:58.760
Mahad!  Now!

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:01.480
My servant, Illusion Magician!

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:05.540
Activate your effect!  Binding Illusion!

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.530
Now you can’t escape.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.040
Don’t underestimate my Diabound.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:17.800
Diabound!  Helical Shockwave!

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.890
Unbelievable!

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:32.890
A single bandit is beating our priests!

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:38.170
At your level, you can't defeat me.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:40.100
You…

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:40.940
Bakura!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:44.710
Is this your ultimate Shadow Game?

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.840
Silence!  I’ll end this game quick!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:52.360
Die with your priests, Pharaoh!

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:54.380
Helical Shockwave!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:59.390
Spiria!

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:09.570
Isis!

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:11.150
How dare you!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:12.880
I told you…

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:18.200
You're no match for me at your level.

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:22.620
Bakura!

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:25.480
Step off of him!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:27.020
Pharaoh!

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:29.250
Pharaoh, it’s dangerous!  Stay back!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.930
Bakura, enough of this ultimate Shadow Game!

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:35.260
Pointless thefts and massacres…

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.860
You even step on the dead!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:41.030
You disgust me!

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:44.040
Oh.  My bad.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:49.100
So you care for this corpse, even though you don't remember him.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.520
Here!  I'll give it back!

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:58.580
Pharaoh Aknamkanon, I never thought you'd return to the palace like this.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:01.640
Pharaoh, you must believe me!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:07.660
As Pharaoh Aknamkanon's long-serving advisor, I declare this:

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:14.530
Your father was a great Pharaoh, dedicating his life to bring peace to this kingdom and its people!

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.820
Pharaoh…

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:20.000
My… father…

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:24.040
Justice lies with the name of the Gods.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.410
That voice…

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:32.910
Yugi, even I don’t fully understand the rules of this ultimate Shadow Game.

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:35.410
But one thing is clear.

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:40.820
You already have the seven Millennium Items in your possession.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:46.830
So if I take them from you, I should win the game.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.990
I'm ending this, Yugi!

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:51.800
You won't that easily!

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.040
Enough nonsense!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.600
Helical Shockwave!

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:58.940
Bakura, you forgot something important.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:03.440
The existence of my most powerful servants - the three Gods!

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:05.120
The three Gods?

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:07.820
The three legendary Gods?

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:12.180
The three God tablets in the Pharaoh’s shrine.

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:17.580
Only the chosen Pharaoh knows the true names of the Gods.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:19.480
But can it be?

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.240
Does this new Pharaoh know?

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:27.240
I'll summon it using the God's name!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.880
The three Gods are my most powerful servants!

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.500
One of their names is…

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:34.510
Justice lies with the name of the Gods.

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:38.600
Father, I'll believe what you said.

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:53.070
I summon Obelisk!

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:00.900
Obelisk?

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:04.270
Kneel before God, Bakura!

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:07.180
God Hand Crusher!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.080
I won't let you!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:13.480
Diabound’s effect!  Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:20.830
What?

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.650
Blue-Eyes is crying out?

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:14.690
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:30.410
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:36.250
Without a goal in mind

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:44.820
We just step towards our dream

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:50.460
